  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7353001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the groaning researcher",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735300101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735300101": {
            "id": "735300101",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "Haha... *sigh*... Hahaha...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300102"
            ]
          },
          "735300102": {
            "id": "735300102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Uh, {NICKNAME}, this guy's laughing and crying at the same time... and he looks pretty familiar, doesn't he?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300103"
            ]
          },
          "735300103": {
            "id": "735300103",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "Ah! It's been a while, you two. Do you still remember me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300105",
              "735300107"
            ]
          },
          "735300105": {
            "id": "735300105",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "It's me, Jami from Amurta! Inventor of the Fayz Potion! You know me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300108"
            ]
          },
          "735300108": {
            "id": "735300108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Paimon thinks she remembers you now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300109"
            ]
          },
          "735300109": {
            "id": "735300109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is your research going well, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300110"
            ]
          },
          "735300110": {
            "id": "735300110",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "Haha... Well... *sigh*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300111"
            ]
          },
          "735300111": {
            "id": "735300111",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Looks like that's a \"no.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300112"
            ]
          },
          "735300112": {
            "id": "735300112",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "No, no, thanks to you, my Fayz Potion research achieved rather impressive results.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300113"
            ]
          },
          "735300113": {
            "id": "735300113",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "But I was so worried about disappointing my mentor... I never expected him to praise my work to the skies.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300114"
            ]
          },
          "735300114": {
            "id": "735300114",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "\"Ah, Jami, well done! A student I am proud of, indeed!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300115"
            ]
          },
          "735300115": {
            "id": "735300115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait. Isn't that a good thing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300116"
            ]
          },
          "735300116": {
            "id": "735300116",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "It would have been good if we had just stopped there, sure... But what happened afterward was a true nightmare.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300117"
            ]
          },
          "735300117": {
            "id": "735300117",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And what happened, exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300118"
            ]
          },
          "735300118": {
            "id": "735300118",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "Maybe the data we got was *too* ideal, because my mentor, that smiling old fella with a wrinkly smile, got it into his head to \"try it himself.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300119"
            ]
          },
          "735300119": {
            "id": "735300119",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "So, I set the experimental site for him, and brewed up the most effective of Fayz Potions...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300120"
            ]
          },
          "735300120": {
            "id": "735300120",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300121"
            ]
          },
          "735300121": {
            "id": "735300121",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "And then... Under the watchful eyes of countless students, he boldly stood right in front of the monsters while drinking the potion and got ambushed for his trouble. They beat him in the blink of an eye...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300122"
            ]
          },
          "735300122": {
            "id": "735300122",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "Fortunately, he's fine. He just needs some bed rest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300123"
            ]
          },
          "735300123": {
            "id": "735300123",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Pfft, hahaha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300124"
            ]
          },
          "735300124": {
            "id": "735300124",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "Hehe... *cough* Regardless, it was my lack of academic proficiency that embarrassed my mentor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300125"
            ]
          },
          "735300125": {
            "id": "735300125",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "That ill-tempered fogey then proceeded to blame me all the more for \"not considering user needs\" and \"lacking awareness of practical circumstances.\" It was a real tongue-lashing, I'll tell you that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300126"
            ]
          },
          "735300126": {
            "id": "735300126",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, that's unreasonable! He's to blame too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735300127"
            ]
          },
          "735300127": {
            "id": "735300127",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "Right? Anyway, that's why I'd like you two to—"
          },
          "735300107": {
            "id": "735300107",
            "speakerId": 30225,
            "speakerName": "Jami",
            "text": "Oh, so you remember that nickname... Yeah, it's me, Jami, the sighing Amurta researcher, shame of my school, and ashamed to this day to speak my name—"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}